{
	$version: "0.1.71.1"
	name: "01: Overview"
	category: "00: Essentials"
	desc:
		'''
		Legacy changes progression significantly to be more approachable. This tutorial assumes you understand Conquest.
		If in doubt, there is probably a tutorial for it.
		'''
	
	order: 1
	size: [456, 0]
	layout: a
	flags: none
	
	title: "Overview"
	sprite_scale: 6
	sprite:
	{
		texture: ui_icons_widget
		size: [16, 16]
		frame: [6, 4]
	}
	entries:
	[
		{
			text: "Overview:"
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bold
		}
		{
			text: "Expect changes to balance and mechanics over time, this tutorial will adapt to any changes."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
		{
			text: "Feel free to ask others for help if the tutorial doesn't suit your needs. But don't pester others."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
		{
			text: "General gameplay differs from conquest, and is closer to TC1. Progression is staged and is inspired by Factorio."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
		{
			text: "Things may feel unapproachable at first if going in blind. The tutorial should help you get started."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
	]
}